  "gameData": {
    "backstory": "Born in the toxic runoff of Subchain City, 'Gridlock' Gristle was raised in the underbelly of the Growl Bikes Garage, learning to scrap and hustle. He witnessed the brutal struggle for DRIP early on, shaping his hard demeanor and drive to control his own destiny. The Scorchshieds Toxic face covering has blocked out the pain, the grid eyes are wired to his bike.",
    "class": "Biker Enforcer",
    "name": "Gridlock Gristle",
    "personality": "Ruthless: Gridlock doesn't hesitate to get his flippers dirty, especially when DRIP is on the line. Resourceful: Growing up in the Garage, he can MacGyver his way out of almost any situation. Intimidating: His sheer size and Vice Grip-clad beak are enough to make most ducks think twice.",
